    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8090" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνείκαστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unattainable by conjecture,
				immense,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>3 Ma.</u>
					1.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλῆθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ps.-Callisth.
					3.20
				</span></i>
			; <i>incomparable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατιώτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polem.
					<u>Call.</u>
					50
				</span></i>
			; 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνήκεστος</span>
